---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import '../styles/style.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Clickerty">
    <div style="display: flex; text-align: center; justify-content: space-evenly; align-items: center; width: 400px;">
        <h1>Hi! I'm Clickerty, and I make things online.</h1>
        <img src="/introductory.png" width="180" height="180" title="A drawing of Clickerty (me) with an arrow pointing to me with the text \'that' me\' made in MS Paint. The drawing is horribly jumbled up." alt="A drawing of Clickerty (me) with an arrow pointing to me with the text \'that' me\' made in MS Paint. The drawing is horribly jumbled up.">
    </div>
    <p>Uh... Well, I don't really have any big projects to show off at the moment, so...</p>
    <img src="/uuhhh.png" height="150" width="400">
    <p>Come back later, I guess. The website is still a work in progress, anyways.</p>
    <p>In the meantime...</p>
    <p>You can find me on all these socials (which are also listed in the bottom right corner of every webpage):</p>
    <div style="display: flex; text-align: center; justify-content: space-around; align-content: space-around; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; width: 400px; height: 80px; text-align: center;">
        <button class="button" style="min-width:90px;" onclick="window.location.href = 'https:\/\/github.com\/ClickertyGaming'">GitHub</button>
        <button class="button" style="min-width:90px;" onclick="window.location.href = 'https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@clickerty3'">YouTube</button>
        <button class="button" style="min-width:90px;" onclick="window.location.href = 'https:\/\/x.com\/clickerty3'">Twitter (not X)</button>
        <button class="button" style="min-width:90px;" onclick="window.location.href = 'https:\/\/bsky.app/profile/clickerty.bsky.social'">Bluesky</button>
        <button class="button" style="min-width:90px;" onclick="window.location.href = 'https:\/\/tumblr.com'">Tumblr</button>
        <button class="button" style="min-width:90px;" onclick="window.location.href = 'https:\/\/clickerty.newgrounds.com'">Newgrounds</button>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:12px; color: gray;">All non-branded art made by me unless specified</p>
</BaseLayout>